# Build context for indexer/deploy/Dockerfile is packages/ (so the indexer's
# `portal:../sdk` sibling is in scope). Docker reads .dockerignore from the
# context root, so packages/indexer/.dockerignore is NOT honored here — these
# rules re-scope those exclusions and add the SDK's build artifacts.

# Indexer
indexer/node_modules
indexer/.yarn
indexer/.pnp.*
indexer/.ponder
indexer/generated
indexer/public
indexer/ponder-env.d.ts
indexer/dist
indexer/.env
indexer/.env.local
indexer/.env.*.local
indexer/*.log
indexer/explorer/node_modules
indexer/explorer/.yarn
indexer/explorer/.pnp.*
indexer/explorer/dist
indexer/explorer/*.tsbuildinfo

# SDK (built inside the image; never ship local artifacts)
sdk/node_modules
sdk/.yarn
sdk/.pnp.*
sdk/dist
sdk/*.log
